certainly unusual for us to meet in a place like this, but as Lisa said, I'm glad to see you.","nextNodeIds":[705060103]},{"nodeId":705060103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2023681866,"text":"Hey, what do you mean by \"a place like this\"? The tavern is a wonderful place to relax and unwind a little.","nextNodeIds":[705060104]},{"nodeId":705060104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3273120978,"text":"*sigh* Do you have any idea how hard it was for me to drag the Acting Grand Master away from her desk?","nextNodeIds":[705060105]},{"nodeId":705060105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3249596106,"text":"We've only been here for a few minutes and worry is already written all over her face.","nextNodeIds":[705060106]},{"nodeId":705060106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"Jean","textMapHash":3981943594,"text":"*sigh* Lisa...","nextNodeIds":[705060107]},{"nodeId":705060107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1194949466,"text":"Well, the Knights of Favonius do have a lot to handle...","nextNodeIds":[705060108]},{"nodeId":705060108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2123133906,"text":"Yeah, this is the Acting Grand Master we're talking about. It's only natural that she has a lot on her plate!","nextNodeIds":[705060109]},{"nodeId":705060109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2581684722,"text":"But you know what they say... \"Now that we're already here...\"","nextNodeIds":[705060110]},{"nodeId":705060110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1740358730,"text":"#Why don't you let {F#her}{M#him} mix a couple of drinks for you two. It'll make you feel a lot better!","nextNodeIds":[705060111]},{"nodeId":705060111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2643145522,"text":"Think of it as a way to unwind.","nextNodeIds":[705060112]},{"nodeId":705060112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":3888059042,"text":"Honestly, Jean is the only person I know who needs to be taught how to relax.","nextNodeIds":[705060113]},{"nodeId":705060113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2768749618,"text":"Hey cutie, whip me up a Love Poem. Medium, extra sweet.","nextNodeIds":[705060114]},{"nodeId":705060114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":205594858,"text":"And how about you, Jean? What are you in the mood for?","nextNodeIds":[705060115]},{"nodeId":705060115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"Jean","textMapHash":2102291026,"text":"I'll just have... coffee. Medium, please.","nextNodeIds":[705060116]},{"nodeId":705060116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1046806250,"text":"Master Jean, you drink coffee all the time. Wouldn't you like to try something else?","nextNodeIds":[705060117]},{"nodeId":705060117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"Jean","textMapHash":699276618,"text":"Thanks, but no. I want something to help keep me awake.","nextNodeIds":[705060118]},{"nodeId":705060118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4075479266,"text":"Got it. Coming right up!","nextNodeIds":[705060119]},{"nodeId":705060119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"Jean","textMapHash":3094762194,"text":"Thanks.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1068,50],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q7050204_Play"}],"execActions":[],